## Ordering constraint found while staging

Commit 17's main.cpp references DialogUI extensions (commit 18), World
(commit 12), Npc placement (commit 12), Menu (commit 19). Since the app
target only builds on Windows, container test gates stay green regardless;
but to keep every commit *logically* buildable on Windows, reorder the app
commits as: 16 (renderer) -> 18' (DialogUI move+ext) -> 19' (Menu+cfg) ->
17' (main loop last, ties everything together). Use that order when
committing, keeping one feature per commit.

